    "DescriptionKey": "searchbodyspace_desc_M",
    "DisplayDescription": "Hockrow Agency \nCase File #MP58235\nLead Investigator: Arken Mallor\n\nCase Summary: \nOur client has reported a friend of hers has gone missing. They\u2019d apparently racked up a substantial debt with a group of outlaws and the client is worried for their safety.\n\n\nContract Investigator Actions:\nWe\u2019ve received word that <EM4>[TargetName]</EM4>\u2019s ship was last seen at <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4> looking heavily damaged. Head to the location and investigate their ship. If you can find their body, verify their status and we can drop back to the client.\n\nAdditional Notes:\nConsider the missing person\u2019s association with outlaws, we advise you to exhibit caution during this investigation.",
